<title>POLAND: LUBAWA OCT NET SWINGS TO PLN 0.3 MLN PROFIT.</title>
<headline>LUBAWA OCT NET SWINGS TO PLN 0.3 MLN PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.26 vs   0.09 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.41 vs   0.12 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.36 vs   0.10 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    1.49 vs   1.15</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.72 vs   1.24</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.86 vs   2.02</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.94 vs   2.37</p>
<p> Sales		   22.49 vs  16.43</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish technical garment maker is</p>
<p>Lubawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
